"Ages 18 months and up."

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:30.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:32.667
Oh, really?
Yeah, babies love the Colosseum.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:34.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.634
