It's a chair!

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:05.367
-Yeah. 200-year-old chair.
Bunch of dead people.

00:01:05.367 --> 00:01:08.267
-Yeah, used to --
-[ Laughing ]

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:09.801
What can you tell me about it?

00:01:09.801 --> 00:01:11.234
-I seat dead people.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:13.601
-Oh. Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:16.601
-It just -- It just comes.
You can't turn it off.

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:18.400
