00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.200
"You okay, buddy?"
-Yeah.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.267
-Yeah.
-"We're good."

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:45.167
