12:00 to 12:01 a.m.

00:02:41.934 --> 00:02:43.133
So, hey.
-Hey, it's Wade.

00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:45.200
-You got a minute,
check this place out.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.000
